{%- comment -%}
  =============================================================================
  STOREFORGE SHARED INDIA-FIRST SNIPPET: UNIFIED TRUST STRIP WRAPPER
  =============================================================================
  Psychological Conversion Framework:
  1. Cognitive Fluency: Grouping Pincode check, COD guarantee, UPI prepaid savings, WhatsApp stylist chat, and GST compliance into a single structured visual container prevents visual clutter below the Buy button.
  2. Authority Stacking: Multiple reinforcing trust vectors (Payment security + Shipping speed + Human support + Tax compliance) eliminate lingering friction at the exact moment of decision.
  
  Design Aesthetics & Rules:
  - 0% Emoji Policy: Clean ASCII typography and responsive grid layout.
  - Universal Theme Heritage: Works seamlessly across Luxury, Streetwear, Beauty, Tech, and Supplements.
  =============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="sf-trust-strip" data-trust-strip>
  <style>
    .sf-trust-strip {
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
      padding-top: 1.25rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12));
      font-family: var(--font-body-family, sans-serif);
    }

    .sf-trust-strip__badges {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .sf-trust-strip__footer {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      padding-top: 0.75rem;
      border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-border, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1));
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .sf-trust-strip__badges {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>

  {%- render 'pincode-checker' -%}

  <div class="sf-trust-strip__badges">
    {%- render 'cod-badge' -%}
    {%- render 'upi-badge' -%}
  </div>

  {%- render 'whatsapp-cta' -%}

  <div class="sf-trust-strip__footer">
    {%- render 'gst-note' -%}
    <div style="font-size: 0.68rem; color: var(--color-text-muted, #666666); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;">
      [ SSL 256-BIT ENCRYPTED CHECKOUT ]
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
